    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Interator to perform a breadth-first traversal of contiguous mesh patch during its construction and then contain cell and node sets that can be used to iterate over the mesh tree.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>SKM </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>15/3/2017</para>
</simplesect>
<xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000157"><xreftitle>Todo</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>needs to be completed to become useful </para>
<para>use this breadth-first graph traversal rather than any other method to discover patch of CELLs. </para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>
    </detaileddescription>
